msgstr "Protocolo {#protocol}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following quantum circuit diagram describes the superdense coding "
"protocol:\n"
msgstr ""
"El siguiente diagrama de circuito cuántico describe el protocolo de "
"codificación superdensa:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Superdense coding circuit](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
