# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In words, here is what Alice does:\n"
msgstr "En palabras, esto es lo que hace Alicia:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $d=1,$ Alice performs a $Z$ gate on her qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ (and if $d=0$"
" she does not).\n"
msgstr ""
"Si $d=1,$ Alicia aplica una compuerta $Z$ a su qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ (y si "
"$d=0$ no hace nada).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $c=1,$ Alice performs an $X$ gate on her qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ (and if "
"$c=0$ she does not).\n"
msgstr ""
"Si $c=1,$ Alicia aplica una compuerta $X$ a su qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ (y si "
"$c=0$ no hace nada).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alice then sends her qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ to Bob.\n"
msgstr "Luego, Alicia le envía su qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ a Bob.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What Bob does when he receives the qubit $\\mathsf{A}$ is to first perform a controlled-NOT gate, with $\\mathsf{A}$ being the control and $\\mathsf{B}$ being the target, and then he applies a Hadamard gate to $\\mathsf{A}.$\n"
"He then measures $\\mathsf{B}$ to obtain $c$ and $\\mathsf{A}$ to obtain $d,$ with standard basis measurements in both cases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuando Bob recibe el qubit $\\mathsf{A}$, primero aplica una compuerta NOT controlada, con $\\mathsf{A}$ como control y $\\mathsf{B}$ como objetivo, y luego aplica una compuerta de Hadamard a $\\mathsf{A}.$\n"
"Después mide $\\mathsf{B}$ para obtener $c$ y $\\mathsf{A}$ para obtener $d,$ usando mediciones en la base estándar en ambos casos.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Analysis {#analysis}"
msgstr "Análisis {#analysis}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The idea behind this protocol is simple:\n"
"Alice effectively chooses which Bell state she would like to be sharing with Bob,\n"
"she sends Bob her qubit, and Bob measures to determine which Bell state Alice chose.\n"
msgstr ""
"La idea detrás de este protocolo es sencilla:\n"
"Alicia elige efectivamente qué estado de Bell quiere compartir con Bob,\n"
"le envía su qubit, y Bob mide para determinar cuál estado de Bell eligió Alicia.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"That is, they initially share $\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle,$ and depending upon the bits $c$ and $d,$ Alice either leaves this state alone or shifts it to one of the other Bell states by applying $\\mathbb{I},$ $X,$ $Z,$ or $XZ$ to her qubit\n"
"$\\mathsf{A}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Es decir, inicialmente comparten $\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle,$ y dependiendo de los bits $c$ y $d,$ Alicia deja ese estado intacto o lo transforma en uno de los otros estados de Bell aplicando $\\mathbb{I},$ $X,$ $Z,$ o $XZ$ a su qubit\n"
"$\\mathsf{A}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes \\mathbb{I}) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle \\\\\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes Z) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle \\\\\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes X) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle \\\\\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes XZ) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\psi^-\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes \\mathbb{I}) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle \\\\\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes Z) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle \\\\\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes X) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle \\\\\n"
"(\\mathbb{I} \\otimes XZ) \\vert \\phi^+ \\rangle & = \\vert \\psi^-\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Bob's actions have the following effects on the four Bell states:\n"
msgstr ""
"Las acciones de Bob producen los siguientes efectos sobre los cuatro estados"
" de Bell:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert \\phi^+\\rangle & \\mapsto \\vert 00\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi^-\\rangle & \\mapsto \\vert 01\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\psi^+\\rangle & \\mapsto \\vert 10\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\psi^-\\rangle & \\mapsto -\\vert 11\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert \\phi^+\\rangle & \\mapsto \\vert 00\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\phi^-\\rangle & \\mapsto \\vert 01\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\psi^+\\rangle & \\mapsto \\vert 10\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert \\psi^-\\rangle & \\mapsto -\\vert 11\\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be checked directly, by computing the results of Bob's operations "
"on these states one at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Esto puede verificarse directamente calculando los resultados de las "
"operaciones de Bob sobre cada uno de estos estados por separado.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"So, when Bob performs his measurements, he is able to determine which Bell state Alice chose.\n"
"To verify that the protocol works correctly is a matter of checking each case:\n"
msgstr ""
"Así, cuando Bob realiza sus mediciones, puede determinar cuál estado de Bell eligió Alicia.\n"
"Verificar que el protocolo funciona correctamente consiste en revisar cada caso:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $cd = 00,$ then the state of $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ when Bob "
"receives $\\mathsf{A}$ is $\\vert \\phi^+\\rangle.$ He transforms this state"
" into $\\vert 00\\rangle$ and obtains $cd = 00.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Si $cd = 00,$ entonces el estado de $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ cuando Bob "
"recibe $\\mathsf{A}$ es $\\vert \\phi^+\\rangle.$ Él transforma este estado "
"en $\\vert 00\\rangle$ y obtiene $cd = 00.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $cd = 01,$ then the state of $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ when Bob "
"receives $\\mathsf{A}$ is $\\vert \\phi^-\\rangle.$ He transforms this state"
" into $\\vert 01\\rangle$ and obtains $cd = 01.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Si $cd = 01,$ entonces el estado de $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ cuando Bob "
"recibe $\\mathsf{A}$ es $\\vert \\phi^-\\rangle.$ Él transforma este estado "
"en $\\vert 01\\rangle$ y obtiene $cd = 01.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $cd = 10,$ then the state of $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ when Bob "
"receives $\\mathsf{A}$ is $\\vert \\psi^+\\rangle.$ He transforms this state"
" into $\\vert 10\\rangle$ and obtains $cd = 10.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Si $cd = 10,$ entonces el estado de $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ cuando Bob "
"recibe $\\mathsf{A}$ es $\\vert \\psi^+\\rangle.$ Él transforma este estado "
"en $\\vert 10\\rangle$ y obtiene $cd = 10.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If $cd = 11,$ then the state of $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ when Bob "
"receives $\\mathsf{A}$ is $\\vert \\psi^-\\rangle.$ He transforms this state"
" into $-\\vert 11\\rangle$ and obtains $cd = 11.$ (The negative-one phase "
"factor has no effect here.)\n"
msgstr ""
"Si $cd = 11,$ entonces el estado de $(\\mathsf{B},\\mathsf{A})$ cuando Bob "
"recibe $\\mathsf{A}$ es $\\vert \\psi^-\\rangle.$ Él transforma este estado "
"en $-\\vert 11\\rangle$ y obtiene $cd = 11.$ (El factor de fase negativo no "
"tiene ningún efecto aquí.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Superdense coding implementation {#superdense-coding-implementation}"
msgstr ""
"Implementación de codificación superdensa {#superdense-coding-"
"implementation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here is a simple implementation of superdense coding where we specify the "
"circuit itself depending on the bits to be transmitted. First we'll choose "
"two bits to be transmitted. (Later we'll choose them randomly, but for now "
"we'll just make an arbitrary choice.)\n"
msgstr ""
"A continuación se presenta una implementación simple de la codificación "
"superdensa donde se especifica el circuito en función de los bits a "
"transmitir. Primero elegiremos dos bits para transmitir. (Más adelante los "
"elegiremos de forma aleatoria, pero por ahora simplemente haremos una "
"elección arbitraria.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we'll build the circuit accordingly. Here we'll allow Qiskit to use the "
"default names for the qubits: $\\mathsf{q}_0$ for the top qubit and "
"$\\mathsf{q}_1$ for the bottom one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora construiremos el circuito correspondiente. Aquí le dejaremos a Qiskit "
"usar los nombres por defecto para los qubits: $\\mathsf{q}_0$ para el qubit "
"superior y $\\mathsf{q}_1$ para el inferior.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-"
"quantum-information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/extracted-"
"outputs/05ae9b94-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
