# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we'll create a job using the Aer simulator that runs the circuit a "
"single time for a given input pair $(x,y).$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora crearemos un trabajo usando el simulador Aer que ejecuta el circuito "
"una sola vez para un par de entrada dado $(x,y).$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we'll play the game 1000 times and compute the fraction that the "
"strategy wins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Por último, jugaremos el juego 1000 veces y calcularemos la fracción de "
"veces que la estrategia gana.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can also define a classical strategy and see how well it works.\n"
"This is just one strategy — others can be tested by changing the code — but it is among the optimal classical strategies.\n"
msgstr ""
"También podemos definir una estrategia clásica y ver qué tan bien funciona.\n"
"Esta es solo una estrategia — se pueden probar otras cambiando el código — pero está entre las estrategias clásicas óptimas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Again let's play the game 1000 times to see how well it works.\n"
msgstr "Juguemos de nuevo el juego 1000 veces para ver qué tan bien funciona.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Although there's randomness involved, the statistics are very unlikely to "
"deviate too much after 1000 runs. The quantum strategy wins about 85% of the"
" time while a classical strategy can't win more than about 75% of the "
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
